      "subject": "כשחר פרש",
      "rationale": "KJV\/ASV 'as the morning spread'; JPS 'as blackness spread' — šegoro se bušwa ke mafologe, eupša leswe le lefsifsi la maru le ka ba se se phadimago dithabeng."
